,"choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"那个太沉了，我就放在外头了……毕竟现在这边也没什么人用了啊！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1421315004:1":{"key":"say:5:1421315004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"前几天还有不少年轻人在这来来去去的，可能是当成游乐场了...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1421315005:1":{"key":"say:6:1421315005:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315005","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"矿洞是矮人的生命线！你、你不负责维护安全就算了，怎么还...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:7:1421315006:1":{"key":"say:7:1421315006:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315006","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"要是像以前那样戒备森严，你们现在也进不来不是。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:8:1421315007:1":{"key":"say:8:1421315007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"……呃，这……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1421315008:1":{"key":"say:9:1421315008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你们也见过乌塔了吧，现在矿洞里就我们几个了，要不是真爱...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:10:1421315008":{"key":"choice_prompt:10:1421315008","kind":"choice_prompt","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1421315008","action_index":"","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你们也见过乌塔了吧，现在矿洞里就我们几个了，要不是真爱矿产，我们也早出去了。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:11:1421315009:1":{"key":"say:11:1421315009:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"11","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315009","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"嗯？哦！你说的是天青矿对吧。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:12:1421315011:1":{"key":"say:12:1421315011:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"12","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315011","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"唔，那种是弗林之前拿来对外当幌子的，如果有人想看深岩晶...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:13:1421315012:1":{"key":"say:13:1421315012:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"13","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315012","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"但实际上它数量不算很多，分布也完全不按照矿石应有的规律...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:14:1421315013:1":{"key":"say:14:1421315013:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"14","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315013","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这矿还算是有点特色，但我们一直有深岩晶在，就没有怎么去...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:15:1421315014:1":{"key":"say:15:1421315014:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"15","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315014","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"所以啊，你们放弃吧，没了深岩晶，我们深岩村就是完蛋的下场！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"key":"choice:10:0:1","kind":"choice","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1421315001","action_index":"","choice_index":"0","choice_id":"1","source_cn":"蓝色的矿石……","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:17:1421315010:1":{"key":"say:17:1421315010:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"17","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1421315010","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"你说铁矿？那算不了什么，到处都有……天青矿？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice:10:1:2":{"key":"choice:10:1:2","kind":"choice","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.MultiChooseNode","statementID":"1421315001","action_index":"","choice_index":"1","choice_id":"2","source_cn":"不是还有矿产吗？","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""}},"speaker_entries":{"speaker:博林":{"key":"speaker:博林","source":"博林"},"speaker:祖娅":{"key":"speaker:祖娅","source":"祖娅"}},"stats":{"source_node_count":18,"graph_node_count":16,"effect_event_count":0,"text_entry_count":17,"speaker_entry_count":2,"cast_state_line_count":14,"path_dependent_cast_state_count":0,"cinematic_count":0,"picture_count":0,"subtitle_count":0,"cinematic_dialogue_count":0}}